| `brake_time`         | Throttle released and brake applied at [s]                         | s  |   0.5 |
| `speed_kmh`         | Initial road speed [km/h], 90 km/h cruise (Hands-on 02)                         | --  |   90 |
| `pedal_cmd`         | Throttle pedal that holds speed_kmh (MappedCarBrakeStop, derived)                         | --  |   0.0916 |
| `rpm0`         | Initial engine speed [rpm], steady at pedal_cmd (MappedCarBrakeStop, derived)                         | --  |   2182 |
